{title: Everybody Will Be Happy Over There}
{key: A}
{x_theme: praise, salvation, joy}
{x_source: chrd:everybody_will_be_happy_over_there.chrd}

{comment: Chorus}
Ev'rybody will be hap[A]py
[D]Will be happy o[A]ver there
We will [A]shout and sing God's praise
Ev'rybody will be [E]happy over [A]there

{comment: Verse 1}
There's a happy land of promise over [D]in the great be[A]yond
Where the saved of earth shall soon the glory [E]share
Where the [A]souls of men shall enter and live [D]on forever [A]more
Ev'rybody will be [E]happy over [A]there

{comment: Verse 2}
Mothers, fathers, sisters, brothers will be [D]singing 'round the [A]throne
In that land where no one ever knows a [E]care
And the [A]Christians of all ages will join [D]in the triumph [A]song
Ev'rybody will be [E]happy over [A]there
